<title>USA: Plainview-Rover SD 7, Ark., won by First Tennessee.</title>
<headline>Plainview-Rover SD 7, Ark., won by First Tennessee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Tennessee Bank, NA, said it won $1 million of Plainview-Rover School District No 7, Ark., refunding and construction limit ed tax bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.3031 percent.</p>
</text>
